<title>USA: Analysis&amp;Tech wins 5-year $18 mln contract.</title>
<headline>Analysis&amp;Tech wins 5-year $18 mln contract.</headline>
<dateline>NORTH STONINGTON, Conn. 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Analysis &amp; Technology Inc said Tuesday it won a contract with a potential value of $18.4 million over five years with the U.S. Navy's coastal systems station in Panama City, Fla.</p>
<p>The company said the contract continues the work it has done since 1990, which includes engineering services for diving and life support, salvage and ocean engineering systems.</p>
</text>
